{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"RestoreMode selects the identity-preserving path. RESTORE_MODE_UNSPECIFIED"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"means an ordinary edit (no restore semantics), keeping forward edits"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"unchanged on the wire."}],"metadata":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Yorkie_V1_RestoreMode"}],"fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Yorkie_V1_RestoreMode","kind":"identifier"}],"symbolKind":"enum","title":"Yorkie_V1_RestoreMode","roleHeading":"Enumeration","role":"symbol","externalID":"s:6Yorkie0A15_V1_RestoreModeO","modules":[{"name":"Yorkie"}]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/Yorkie_V1_RestoreMode"},"sections":[],"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Yorkie\/s12CaseIterableP","doc:\/\/Yorkie\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/Yorkie\/SQ","doc:\/\/Yorkie\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/Yorkie\/SH","doc:\/\/Yorkie\/SY","doc:\/\/Yorkie\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Yorkie\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/Yorkie\/13SwiftProtobuf4EnumP"],"kind":"relationships"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Yorkie_V1_RestoreMode","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For elements it selects between reviving the element already in the tree and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"inserting a copy of it. The copy is what undo does today, and because a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"deep copy keeps every descendant’s created_at, it puts a second live element","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"under ids the document is indexed by. Reviving needs a replicated liveness","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"register – removed_at paired with revived_at on each element – so that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"every replica resolves a remove\/revive race the same way, with a tie going","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to the removal as the shipped remove register already does.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The branch cannot be chosen from local state. A replica that collected","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"between the removal and the undo has purged the tombstone, and one that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"joined from a later snapshot never had it, so “revive if a tombstone is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"present” is a function of local collection timing and the same change log","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"would produce different documents. That is why the branch is on the wire.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/yorkie\/yorkie_v1_restoremode"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie"]]},"topicSections":[{"title":"Enumeration Cases","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/Yorkie_V1_RestoreMode\/UNRECOGNIZED(_:)","doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/Yorkie_V1_RestoreMode\/restore","doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/Yorkie_V1_RestoreMode\/retombstone","doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/Yorkie_V1_RestoreMode\/unspecified"],"anchor":"Enumeration-Cases","generated":true},{"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/Yorkie_V1_RestoreMode\/init()","doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/Yorkie_V1_RestoreMode\/init(rawValue:)"],"anchor":"Initializers","generated":true},{"title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Yo